# RFE constants directory
#
# Shared constants (elev.nc, lsm.nc) are symlinked from datasets/imerg/cGAN_data/.
#
# RFE run11 requires RFE_climatology_meansd_doy.nc here for the 2 climatology
# channels (day-of-year climatological mean and std of RFE2 precipitation).
# This file is not tracked in git due to size; deploy it from your training
# data archive. Without it the model falls back to zero-fill placeholders.
